ist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrbhardy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrbhardy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrbhardy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrbhardy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrbhardy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrbhardy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Related to Errata #157 and [Arlington Issue #90](https://github.com/pdf-association/arlington-pdf-model/issues/90), but specifically for logical structure. This is effectively checking the rules for any objects that can be an array (either directly or as a value in a name or number-tree) - can the following array objects in logical structure contain `null` objects as array elements? \r\n\r\n* **StructTreeRoot/K** array - can this have `null` array elements?\r\n\r\n* **StructTreeRoot/ParentTree** - specifically when the value in the number-tree is an array \"_For a page object or content stream containing marked-content sequences that are content items, the value shall be an array of references to the parent elements of those marked-content sequences._\" - can an element in that array be `null`? It would appear at least one popular implementation uses 'null`...\r\n\r\n* **StructElem/K** - noting that the array format can be an array of various kinds of dicts, or an array of integers\r\n\r\n* **StructElem/A** - noting also that this array can have an optional revision number after a dict/stream entry so there is potential ambiguity as to whether a `null` is a dict/stream or revision  in the array elements\r\n\r\n* **StructElem/C** - noting also that this array can have an optional revision number after a name so there is potential ambiguity as to whether a `null` is a name or revision in the array elements\r\n\r\n* **StructElem/Ref**\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"petervwyatt","id":26521615,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTIxNjE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26521615?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt","html_url":"https://github.com/petervwyatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petervwyatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pdf-association/pdf-issues/issues/308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pdf-association/pdf-issues/issues/308/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}